        "latex": "\\beta_{w1}\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ \\alpha_{w}>0.5\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle \\frac{396}{13\\alpha_{w}-1}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle \\frac{36}{\\max\\left(\\alpha_{w},0.01\\right)}\\right.\\end{array}",
