        "latex": "M_{cr}\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ L_{LT}>0\\,\\mathrm{m}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle C_{1}N_{cr.LT}\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{I_{w}}{I_{z}}+\\frac{GI_{t}}{N_{cr.LT}}+\\left(C_{2}z_{g}\\right)^2}-C_{2}z_{g}\\right)\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle 0\\,\\mathrm{kN}\\cdot\\mathrm{m}\\right.\\end{array}",
